### Changes from Initial Draft & Rationale

| Change | Reason |
|--------|--------|
| Removed `inventory_has melon_slice < 1` rule | The `inventory_has` rule type only supports `min_count` (≥ comparison). There is no `lt`/`comparison` parameter in the schema. The primary rule (`melon_seeds >= 1`) is sufficient since the player starts with 0 melon_seeds. |
| Removed `inventory_has gold_ingot < 1` rule | Same schema limitation. The primary rule (`golden_pickaxe >= 1`) is sufficient since the player starts with 0 golden_pickaxes. |
| Fixed rule format to use `params` wrapper | Schema requires `{"type": "...", "params": {"item": "...", "min_count": N}}` |
| Changed `id` to `milestone_id` | Correct field name per specification |
| Expanded `description` to explain WHY | Each description now states both WHAT is checked and WHY `inventory_has` was chosen |
| Single rule per milestone | One clear, reliable rule is better than multiple rules when the secondary rules aren't supported by the schema |

